namespace WebRecomp.Web.Services.Engine30;

/// <summary>
/// Engine 3.0 descriptive workout-type catalog.
///
/// IMPORTANT:
///
/// A workout type describes the kind of physical work being performed.
/// It does NOT define a fixed calorie burn or fixed glycogen cost.
///
/// Calories and glycogen remain individualized from:
/// - duration
/// - resolved RPE
/// - objective workload when available
/// - FFM or body weight as appropriate to modality
/// - resistance rest/density
/// - hard sets / muscle recruitment
/// - interval structure
/// - monitor/HR evidence
/// - prior fuel state
///
/// Default RPE values are config-style starting values for planning.
/// They are user-editable and may later be replaced by a personalized
/// planned RPE learned from the individual's completed workouts.
///
/// ZONE2_CARDIO default RPE = 3 is an explicit Engine 3.0 requirement.
/// </summary>

